  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.6;\">'말머리'에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요^^</span><br></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.</span></b></span></p></div><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px;\">뿌리가&nbsp;물&nbsp;흡수하는&nbsp;원리&nbsp;수업&nbsp;후,&nbsp;세포막과&nbsp;삼투현상을&nbsp;오래&nbsp;기억할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있게&nbsp;계란분수&nbsp;동영상&nbsp;숙제를&nbsp;내줬다.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px;\">식초에&nbsp;하루&nbsp;담궜다가&nbsp;녹은&nbsp;껍질&nbsp;제거&nbsp;후&nbsp;물에&nbsp;몇&nbsp;시간&nbsp;담궈뒀다&nbsp;뾰족한&nbsp;걸로&nbsp;구멍내서&nbsp;분수확인하기.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px;\">밴드에&nbsp;동영상으로&nbsp;올릴&nbsp;부분은&nbsp;빵빵해진&nbsp;계란을&nbsp;터뜨릴&nbsp;때부터&nbsp;분수나올&nbsp;때까지만.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px;\">재미난&nbsp;기억&nbsp;한&nbsp;토막이길^^</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px;\">개인별&nbsp;점수&nbsp;부과하기로&nbsp;했는데&nbsp;몇&nbsp;놈이나&nbsp;낼꺼나..</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px;\"></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><br style=\"font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\">아래는&nbsp;지난&nbsp;주&nbsp;금요일에&nbsp;내준&nbsp;숙제를&nbsp;성공리에&nbsp;클리어한&nbsp;두&nbsp;학생&nbsp;작품~</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><iframe id=\"v98feD8iiV1DaGn1b2DPa4V\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v98feD8iiV1DaGn1b2DPa4V?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY5OGZlRDhpaVYxRGFHbjFiMkRQYTRWIiwidGlkIjoiMzQ5NzEyOWUtYzBjNC00NzQ4LWJiOTQtNzRiYTZkODU1NDQxIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg1MTAxfQ.eXrGxMoH7-4oAdLZP5SpOxXd3THbhkwZ1uQU4nPD450lg851RaEm7dD8jh1S0cLq330-LHZf5HcavacTVmlK1g&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"v476c830xmuxyBj3r8J0w5x\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v476c830xmuxyBj3r8J0w5x?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY0NzZjODMweG11eHlCajNyOEowdzV4IiwidGlkIjoiNzE5NTNiMTEtNmEzZi00ZmNiLTg4MDktODA4MTBhMDUwOGE1IiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg1MTAxfQ.iu2fbMTudapzMhctnAteLEb9O8pYV_jYm7AL9V2CYwCgKwKq6qkv128vpVN2t_WRYBjEf-GB-sGT5oepdXya9g&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br style=\"color: r